  "cue_limits": [
    "All ten cues are incomplete exact-surface-plus-POS proxies, not grammatical roles, complete constructions, speaker identity, stylistic validity, or author evidence.",
    "First/second/third-person form lists gated by PRON cover only listed overt forms; they do not resolve omitted subjects, referents, roles, quotation voice, or coreference.",
    "Negator forms gated by ADV exclude other negation tagged AUX/VERB/PART and segmentation-dependent combinations; label as listed ADV-negator token share.",
    "Aspect-like forms 了/着/著/过/過 gated by AUX do not count sentence-final PART uses and do not guarantee aspect semantics, completeness, or correct parsing.",
    "Traditional-form entries in a simplified-Chinese model do not establish traditional-Chinese accuracy; do not normalize source text silently.",
    "Same orthography can have multiple POS and relations; retain exact token spans, full relations, and observed denominator, with missing and unsupported values distinct from zero.",
    "Treebank PART also covers many affix-like units, so PART frequency is not equivalent to a closed-class functional-particle frequency."
  ],
